<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech SPIF 1996 audited CZK 215mln net.</title>
<headline>Czech SPIF 1996 audited CZK 215mln net.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Czech investment fund SPIF Cesky a.s. said on Thursday it had posted audited 1996 net profits of 215 million crowns versus 254 million in 1995, according to Czech accounting standards.  </p>
<p>Results for year ending Decmeber 31, 1996 (in millions of crowns).</p>
<p>				    1996	   vs	 1995</p>
<p> Total assets	     11,101.533		9,950.973</p>
<p> Operating profit	   -245.017(loss)	 -101.838(loss)</p>
<p> After tax profit	    215.175		  253.850</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit		226.243		  331.386</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
